### Describe the bug

scrolling on a grid-wrap does not clear the highlight nor sets a new highlight in the currently visible area. this means the next time a user uses a arrow key the scroll will jump back to the item that was highlighted previously. 

While this is not an issue when using exclusively the mouse as it hovers over items it changes the current Highlight, this becomes an issue when using the keyboard only or a mix of keyboard and mouse. 

Also, hovering that item does not seem to set the currentHiglight and even when hovering a item, pressing a item still causes the scroll to jump back to where it was before

I have tested this with GridWrap and List, but probably applies to all collection widgets

### How to reproduce

1. Create a grid wrap (and probably any collection item)
2. Use the keyboard to highlight one item
3. scroll to the (or anywhere) bottom
4. Press Navigation key
5. Observe jumping back to the previously selected item instead of staying withing the current visible area

